cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CREVICE, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "CREVICE: Cavity and Residue Environment Visualisation, Interaction and Connectivity Evaluation"
abstract: >-
  CREVICE is a Python package for protein cavity, pore, tunnel, channel and
  residue-interaction analysis in static structures and molecular dynamics
  trajectories.
type: software
version: 0.4.0
date-released: "2026-10-22"
license: MIT
